  "email": "sofia.rossi@brightline.example",
  "reason": "Identify sender, devices, and account status for vague computer issue"
}

{
  "hostname": "BL-LT-0107",
  "reason": "Check laptop health for recurring unspecified issue"
}

{
  "outcome": "needs_user_info",
  "reply_to_user": "Hi Sofia, sorry your computer is giving you trouble again. I'd like to get this fixed, but I need a bit more detail first: 1) What is \"the thing\"? For example, is it running slowly, freezing, crashing or showing a blue screen, not connecting to Wi-Fi or VPN, or showing an error message? If you see an error, please send the exact wording or a screenshot. 2) When did it start this time, and roughly how often does it happen? 3) Did it start after an update or after you installed a new app? 4) When did you last fully restart the laptop (Start > Power > Restart, not just closing the lid)? Also, our records show your laptop hasn't connected to our management system in about 12 days. Is it the laptop you're having trouble with? Has it been on and connected to the internet recently? If you haven't restarted in a while, please try a full restart now and let me know if that helps. If you have an earlier ticket about this problem, the ticket number would help too.",
  "internal_note": "Ticket was vague (\"doing the thing again\"). Checked the user's account: active, not locked, 0 failed sign-ins, not VIP. One assigned device, BL-LT-0107 (Win 11 Pro). Device check: offline, last check-in 2026-09-27 (12-day no-check-in warning). Disk is fine at 54.7% free (140/256 GB), so low disk space (KB-017) is ruled out. The 12-day gap could mean the laptop is off or broken, isn't reaching the network, or the management agent has a problem. It may be related to the reported issue. Asked the user to describe the symptom, how often it happens, whether it followed an update or new app, when she last restarted, whether the device has been online, and any earlier ticket number for the recurring issue. Following KB-019 quick checks while waiting on details. If she reports blue screens or repeated crashes, or the device won't come online, escalate per KB-019.",
  "kb_articles": [
    "KB-019",
    "KB-017"
  ],
  "confidence": "medium"
}
